            <ArticleTitle>Shoulder pain: a common-but-challenging problem.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>37-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Although shoulder pain is a common complaint among patients presenting to primary care physicians, many clinicians are unfamiliar with how to diagnose and treat many shoulder ailments. This article reviews the basic approach to diagnosis and management of shoulder pain in adult patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
